      "cooked": "<p>I think I know the answer to this question, but Caspit's Playground in Freedom Tower says all hero ongoing cards also have the Equipment keyword. Does that only apply to the ones in play, or does it include the trash, hand and deck as well?</p><p>If it applies to all of them, that provides a massive boost to cards like Salvage Yard, Impromptu Invention or Arsenal Access.</p>",
